        "passage": "A shipping manifest reads: \"The crates delivered to the Crypts contained: [underlined: ancient coins, sealed letters, and fragments of a broken mirror].\"",
        "question_stem": "In the passage above, which version of the underlined portion is correct?",
        "option_a": "contained: ancient coins, sealed letters, and fragments of a broken mirror",
