        "pre_narrative": "The Post-Colon Phantom worries only about what comes AFTER the colon — not before it. He has scattered incorrect capitalizations and comma errors into the words that follow each colon. A crypt visitor's guide has been corrupted. Find the correctly punctuated version.",
        "passage": "A crypt visitor's guide reads: \"The Crypts have three rules: [underlined: no flames in the reading rooms, no removal of artifacts, and absolutely no speaking in the sealed chambers].\"",
        "question_stem": "In the passage above, which version of the underlined portion is correct?",
        "option_a": "No flames in the reading rooms, no removal of artifacts, and absolutely no speaking in the sealed chambers",
