        "enemy_type": "Ancient Scribe",
        "pre_narrative": "The Dramatic Dash lurks in the darkest corner of the Crypts, arguing that em dashes and colons are interchangeable. They are not — and the difference matters on the ACT. He has corrupted the Keep's most dramatic historical announcement. Determine which mark is precisely correct in context.",
        "passage": "A historical announcement reads: \"After forty years of searching, the explorers found what they had been looking for[underlined: — a single unbroken seal bearing the crest of the First Keep].\"",
        "question_stem": "In the passage above, which version of the underlined portion is correct?",
