        "pre_narrative": "The Grand Crypt Warden is the final keeper of the Colon Crypts. He presents a passage from the Crypts' founding charter — a document containing two colon-related choices in quick succession. Both must be correct for the charter to stand. He has introduced one error; you must identify and correct it.",
